# Golden snapshot files are compared byte-for-byte against emitter output,
# which is built from template literals using LF. Force LF on every platform
# so a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true) does not CRLF-ify the snapshots
# and break the golden tests. Scope is intentionally limited to the snapshot
# tree; the rest of the repo keeps its own line-ending conventions.
test/snapshots/** text eol=lf